{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Punch through the cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Lobstar: Arcade Version</i> is a shoot-em-up where you cannot shoot bullets. Instead, you can punch those bullets back at foes--or get in the enemy's face and punch them yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/4_punch2_optimized.gif?t=1746046546\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/star_features_header.png?t=1746046546\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Punch Past it All!</strong> Punch bullets\u00a0to deflect\u00a0them.\u00a0They will\u00a0automatically fly at the\u00a0nearest\u00a0enemy. You can also defeat most\u00a0enemies in\u00a0one punch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shine Bright with Star Time: </strong>Perform a <strong>Lobster Roll </strong>to evade an attack with good timing to enable\u00a0<strong>Star\u00a0Time</strong>. You cannot take damage during Star Time, so go crazy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lobstars Never Die: </strong>Cosmic lobster &quot;The Lobstar&quot; is immortal and cannot die. Getting hit\u00a0will push it\u00a0back,\u00a0but this will not deter it from\u00a0its\u00a0destination. While anyone can clear the game,  the credits won't roll for just anyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shoot for the Stars: </strong>Go for\u00a0a\u00a0high score or\u00a0a\u00a0fast\u00a0clear\u00a0time with the in-game ranking and timer functions! Crazy-quick crustaceans may even catch up with the edge of the universe itself...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/1_startime_optimized.gif?t=1746046546\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.