ver Die: </strong>Cosmic lobster &quot;The Lobstar&quot; is immortal and cannot die. Getting hit\u00a0will push it\u00a0back,\u00a0but this will not deter it from\u00a0its\u00a0destination. While anyone can clear the game,  the credits won't roll for just anyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shoot for the Stars: </strong>Go for\u00a0a\u00a0high score or\u00a0a\u00a0fast\u00a0clear\u00a0time with the in-game ranking and timer functions! Crazy-quick crustaceans may even catch up with the edge of the universe itself...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/extras/1_startime_optimized.gif?t=1746046546\" /></p>","developers":["Team Lobstar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659140/a5ac421a201ce30f7abeddc7ea467aca17c9a916/header.jpg?t=1746046546","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2016</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.12 or later</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130562,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130562/movie480.mp4?t=1746046543","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130562/movie_max.mp4?t=1746046543"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130562/e6199d3d8d6d0e6e9d93aabca13648b7e2037063/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746046543","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130562/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746046543","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130562/movie_m